This privacy policy pertains to the Sombrio app.

Sombrio does not collect any personal information. It connects to the media servers you sign in to (Jellyfin, or for
music also Navidrome and other Subsonic servers), to GitHub to look for newer builds of the app, and, when your server
has no lyrics for a song, to LRCLIB (lrclib.net), which it sends the song's title, artist, album and length. Looking up
lyrics on LRCLIB can be turned off in the music player's settings (Layout & Theme, Lyrics). No identifying information or
user data of any kind is made available to anyone else.

Sombrio is built on Findroid, by Jarne Demeulemeester, and sombrAMP, which is built on Finamp.
